<metadata><name>Day 30 - Mill Pond, Cataract</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.824871" lon="-80.004030"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Forks of the Credit Parking Area: Enter from McLaren Rd (1.9 km south of Peel Rd 24). Paid: $18 per vehicle (full day), $8.50 (4 hours) · book ahead</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.817484" lon="-80.014917"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Mill Pond Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.821119" lon="-80.022020"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: End of the Mill Pond Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.813979" lon="-80.015659"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn sharp right onto the blue-blazed Cataract Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
